### CoffeeNChill Menu API - HTTP Test File
### Author: Neha Heeralal ST10478910
###
### Usage:
###   1. Ensure the API is running locally: cd CoffeeNChill.Functions && func start
###   2. Click "Send Request" above any request below to execute it
###   3. Requires the REST Client extension (VS Code) or built-in support (Visual Studio)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:7071/api

### ============================================================
### 1. Health Check - Verify the API is running
### ============================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### ============================================================
### 2. Create Menu Item - POST
### ============================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/menu
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "Drinks",
  "sku": "COF-001",
  "name": "Hot Coffee",
  "description": "Freshly brewed dark roast",
  "price": 3.5,
  "isAvailable": true
}

### ============================================================
### 3. Get All Menu Items
### ============================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/menu

### ============================================================
### 4. Get Single Item by Category and SKU
### ============================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/menu/Drinks/COF-001

### ============================================================
### 5. Get Items by Category
### ============================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories/Drinks

### ============================================================
### 6. Update Menu Item - PUT
### ============================================================
PUT {{baseUrl}}/menu/Drinks/COF-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Extra Hot Coffee",
  "price": 4.5,
  "isAvailable": true
}

### ============================================================
### 7. Delete Menu Item - DELETE
### ============================================================
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/menu/Drinks/COF-001

### ============================================================
### 8. Verify Deletion (should return 404 Not Found)
### ============================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/menu/Drinks/COF-001